    "abstract": "Parts figure for the crew oxygen cylinder installation showing the cradle and saddle group, the outlet valve and non-return valve, and the charging connection.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the parts of the crew oxygen cylinder installation, including the cradle group, the outlet hardware and the charging connection.",
      "figure_note": "Every item on this figure is an oxygen service part and must be supplied cleaned and sealed for oxygen use. Do not substitute a general-purpose equivalent even where the dimensions agree. The non-return valve at item 20 carries pre and post modification effectivity because the seat material changed with the transducer standard. The moulded saddle at item 40 exists only post modification and is not procurable separately from the cradle strap set."
    },
